ews.png\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>News</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"home-button centered-text\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/guidance/guidance-notes\" class=\"white-text cf\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"home-button-inner cf\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/assets/HomepageIcons/12443c03e3/guidance.png\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Guidance Notes</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"home-button centered-text\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/guidance/timing-rules-calculator\" class=\"white-text cf\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"home-button-inner cf\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/assets/HomepageIcons/e7de67f14b/calendar.png\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Timing Rules Calculator</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\t<div class=\"inner cf\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"inner-padding cf\">\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col span-2-of-3 left\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Featured</h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"issues-home pos-1\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"red-border\"><a href=\"/guidance/guidance-notes/independent-advisers\">Independent Advisers </a></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"light-grey-text location\">Guidance<span class=\"pipe\">|</span>Published Apr 7, 2026 </p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"intro\">Introduction<br />\n<br />\nThe purpose of this Guidance Note is to assist those who are approved as independent advisers by the Panel to prepare a report under any of rules 18, 21, 22, or 57 of the Takeovers Code\u2026</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/guidance/guidance-notes/independent-advisers\" class=\"view mid-grey-text red-theme\">Read More<span class=\"fa fa-angle-right red-bg\"></span></a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"issues-home pos-2\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"blue-border\"><a href=\"/guidance/codeword/issue-59/updates-to-guidance-notes\">Updates to Guidance Notes</a></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"light-grey-text location\">Guidance<span class=\"pipe\">|</span>Published Apr 7, 2026 </p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"intro\">Introduction<br />\nFollowing recent transactions and law reform coming into effect, the Panel has approved amendments to the following Guidance Notes:[1]<br />\n<br />\nSection 32 of the Takeovers Act 1993;<br />\nControl and\u2026</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/guidance/codeword/issue-59/updates-to-guidance-notes\" class=\"view mid-grey-text blue-theme\">Read More<span class=\"fa fa-angle-right blue-bg\"></span></a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"issues-home pos-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"red-border\"><a href=\"/guidance/guidance-notes/upstream-acquisitions\">Upstream Acquisitions</a></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"light-grey-text location\">Guidance<span class=\"pipe\">|</span>Published Apr 7, 2026 </p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"intro\">Introduction<br />\n<br />\nAn upstream acquisition is a transaction (whether in New Zealand or overseas) that may indirectly affect control of a Code company.[1] \u00a0Where an upstream company (an Upstream Company\u2026</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/guidance/guidance-notes/upstream-acquisitions\" class=\"view mid-grey-text red-theme\">Read More<span class=\"fa fa-angle-right red-bg\"></span></a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"issues-home pos-4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"red-border\"><a href=\"/guidance/guidance-notes/control-and-association\">Control and Association</a></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"light-grey-text location\">Guidance<span class=\"pipe\">|</span>Published Apr 7, 2026 </p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"intro\">Introduction<br />\n<br />\nThis Guidance Note sets out the Panel\u2019s approach to control and association, which are key concepts for the operation of the Takeovers Code (the Code), including from an anti-avoidance\u2026</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/guidance/guidance-notes/control-and-association\" class=\"view mid-grey-text red-theme\">Read More<span class=\"fa fa-angle-right red-bg\"></span></a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col span-1-of-3 left sidebar\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"useful-guides\">\r\n\t<h2 class=\"background-grey-bg\">Useful Guides</h2>\r\n\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"guide-inner background-grey-bg blue-theme cf\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/guidance/guide-for-shareholders\" class=\"guide text-grey-text cf\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"guide-info image\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/assets/HomepageIcons/Textures-for-icons/1d618a9e79/guide-01.jpg\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"guide-info text\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Guide for Shareholders</h5>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Understand how the Code protects shareholders&#039; rights</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"view mid-grey-text\">Read More <span class=\"fa fa-angle-right blue-bg\"></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"guide-inner background-grey-bg avocado-theme cf\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/guidance/guide-for-directors\" class=\"guide text-grey-text cf\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"guide-info image\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/assets/HomepageIcons/b947f4bb12/guide-02.jpg\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"guide-info text\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Guide for Directors</h5>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Learn more about directors&#039; obligations to shareholders</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"view mid-grey-text\">Read More <span class=\"fa fa-angle-right avocado-bg\"></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"guide-inner background-grey-bg teal-theme cf\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/guid